Bird Blocks
===========

An independent Tetris-style game for WoW Forever (interface 16001, game
version 1.60.1), designed to be played during flight-path taxi rides.

Not affiliated with or endorsed by Blizzard Entertainment, Nintendo, Tetris
Holding, or CurseForge.

Trademarks
----------

"Tetris" is a registered trademark of Tetris Holding LLC. This addon is a
non-commercial homage that reproduces the rules of the classic 1989 handheld
and NES games for study and personal play. It ships no code, art, audio or
other assets from those games.

Assets
------

Everything in this repository is original and generated from source:

- `BirdBlocks/tiles.tga` and `BirdBlocks/icon.tga` are drawn by
  `tools/make_assets.py` (pixel shapes and a 5x7 bitmap font).
- `BirdBlocks/sfx/*.ogg` are synthesized square/triangle/noise waveforms.
- `BirdBlocks/music/theme.ogg` is an original arrangement of the traditional
  folk song *Korobeiniki*, whose melody is in the public domain. The
  arrangement, performance and recording are generated by the same script.
- All Lua is written for this project.

Credits
-------

Frame timings, rotation behaviour and scoring follow the publicly documented
behaviour of Tetris (Game Boy, 1989) and Tetris (NES, Nintendo, 1989), as
summarized by the community at tetris.wiki. The texture/quad approach follows
the patterns used by Polestar Arcade for this client.

